<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant groups in Nigeria's Niger state have carried out a reprisal attack that killed at least 30 civilians, while separate assaults killed 11 soldiers in the southeast, 16 near the Malian border and 25 in another strike. Fulani communities suffered mass killings of at least 64 people, and insurgents have begun using off-the-shelf drones in attacks. In Mali, rebels report that more than 300 Russian soldiers have been killed as Moscow backs the military junta, and a Russian envoy claims Ukrainian officers are training Sahel armed groups on drone tactics. The Sahel jihadist insurgency caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxOUW5aeXpDUldIYjR5RlZ2bVdyUHFKZUtRcEUwTERNc3ZTRVFWTlNRSEZjV05VMVNyNG1KTXZNelVaQUJVaUlObUlqYXl5MV85b0hrTDdJMlA4YVcyanRXVVhrV19vUjBqRmR2WDBzcnY2MlFsTjdoS0paNGFTQWdESk5Lcm9GeWNSbUN6dkJwbDhwWk5WR1FqWXVWS1dYVjFVcElvNDd2RS11NnprbVVUdWl3cVVkVC16?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxON0RjeHRWcGl1ZElENEhBX0x2blI3b2w1OC1vZ1U3SklwRTV5ajRTWVRXczVBTlBrN0JkQldfZEozLTU1b3AxUDJTM3dnX3FoTldYTmZVZWF3dW4xSFM0c2gtWS1yTWRvSmlsRDhMa1ZncXIybHVKaXlhZE9FSHNaanRCckd2RHA0cHVOVldWUmVKMGhUV1JUZG95amFmQ3oyWjBYNmZVSl80ZzhT?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxOUGduMFl3WldqdzVkNER1WU9RS0RCZmdKYkRWa2QxR0pyNkpPdnBzZHFpbC1hMHpiTXJNZnQ1TzloTU5aZTRmN3VBTzJYRjNuN1NiRDJYcnp3NEI2dE5rY2dESTJyaGFxeXB2VFc0NXhXNmNoMjBWNlAxWVpIemVHSWhOdzFScVV3dWd0MnU2Z2pGaS1RRTJkZXhXRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE80VndCa0pDRG9Fd2xwWkxXQ1pWd1ZJZUZVdGtSdDJmUHlSMGVGREM5eGk2eF9OZENpNkhIRmxlQm9oU3ZfTTdaU3o3SmJnNE01X1d1d1RWa3VtTmUzQXhRZnJ3bWk3UGhCMTNWSWRiV1hXam